WEBVTT

00:15:58.363 --> 00:16:02.497
and empower us to realize
how much more there is to having a child

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:05.163
than trying to shape a specific outcome.

00:16:05.597 --> 00:16:07.563
So much more,

00:16:07.563 --> 00:16:12.963
which I appreciate every day
in moments with my firstborn son,

00:16:12.997 --> 00:16:14.663
who is thriving

00:16:14.697 --> 00:16:16.563
and with his younger brother

00:16:16.563 --> 00:16:18.930
and the unique paths they are taking.

00:16:19.530 --> 00:16:22.030
We are not screwed.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:23.463
(Laughter)

00:16:24.063 --> 00:16:26.930
The science of parents and children,

00:16:26.963 --> 00:16:29.263
butterflies and their hurricanes,

00:16:29.263 --> 00:16:33.297
can free people to focus
on what is most important